   "where": "p · Bounce-back infusion",
   "original": "Hangovers are dehydration plus the byproducts of ethanol — and the ability to bounce back only diminishes with age. The Party Drip pairs a full liter of fluids with anti-inflammatory and anti-nausea medication so you can get on with your day. Before Toradol, make sure you haven't taken any NSAIDs (such as ibuprofen or naproxen) in the 4–6 hours prior and aren't allergic. Feeling extremely nauseous? Ask your nurse about a double dose of Zofran.",
